.TH PATINA-AUTOSTART 1 "2026-10-19" "patina-desktop 0.1.0" "Patina Desktop"
.SH NAME
patina-autostart \- start the programs set to start with the session
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B patina-autostart
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B patina-autostart
starts the programs in the XDG autostart directories, then exits:
.I ~/.config/autostart
first, then
.IR /etc/xdg/autostart .
A file in the user's directory replaces the system file of the same name, so
.B Hidden=true
there turns a program off. Entries limited to other desktops
.RB ( OnlyShowIn ,
.BR NotShowIn )
or turned off with
.B X-GNOME-Autostart-enabled=false
are skipped.
.B patina-session
runs it once the compositor is up.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR patina-session (1)
